@startuml
left to right direction
actor Operator
actor "Human reviewer" as Human
actor GitHub
rectangle "OpenCode Ticket Enhancer" {
  usecase "Run one poll" as Poll
  usecase "Task judge role" as Judge
  usecase "Task doer role" as Doer
  usecase "Check readiness and stops" as Gate
  usecase "Update issue status" as Update
}
Operator --> Poll
Poll .> Judge : includes
Poll .> Doer : includes
Poll .> Gate : includes
Poll --> Update
Human --> Update : LGTM
GitHub --> Update
@enduml
